    "local": {
      "type": "local-area",
      "blocks": {
        "b1": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Stamped patios are our calling card here",
            "text": "<p>The Orem jobs below include an ashlar slate patio, a wood-plank patio and a stamped patio built around a stone fire pit. If you are choosing between a plain and a patterned finish, start with <a href=\"/pages/stamped-concrete-patios\">stamped patios</a> and <a href=\"/pages/concrete-patios\">plain patios</a> side by side.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Side yards, walkways and pads",
            "text": "<p>Not every job is a showpiece. We also pour <a href=\"/pages/concrete-walkways\">walkways</a> from the gate to the garage, <a href=\"/pages/rv-pads\">RV pads</a>, <a href=\"/pages/hot-tub-pads\">hot tub pads</a> and <a href=\"/pages/shed-pads\">shed pads</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Established yards",
            "text": "Mature trees, fences and sprinklers limit access. We plan the route with you first and pump or wheel concrete in when a truck cannot reach."
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Replacing a small original patio",
            "text": "We can tear out the old slab, haul it away and pour a larger one to suit how you use the yard."
          }
        },
        "b5": {
          "type": "detail",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Pattern and color you can see first",
            "text": "We bring samples during the design step so you choose with the house in front of you."
          }
        }
      },
